    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Galvin Property present this exceptional opportunity to acquire a superb three-bedroom, own-door duplex apartment in the highly sought-after residential development of Stralem Crescent Ongar Village, extending to approximately 98 sqm (1,055 sq. ft).\r\n\r\nNo. 14 Stralem Crescent is one of the larger-style three-bedroom duplexes within the development, offering generous and well-proportioned accommodation arranged over two levels. The property comprises a bright reception room with sliding doors providing direct access to a large private balcony, together with a separate fully fitted kitchen/dining room. There are three generously sized bedrooms, including a main bedroom with en suite, along with a family bathroom. The property has been well maintained and has recently been freshly painted, with new flooring fitted throughout. A second private balcony provides additional outdoor space, while ample communal parking is available within the development. With its generous accommodation, convenient duplex layout and an efficient B level BER certificate, No. 14 will appeal to both owner-occupiers and investors alike and is well worth viewing.\r\n\r\nOngar Village is a well-established and popular residential location within the quiet enclave of Dublin 15, offering an excellent range of amenities in close proximity, including Dunnes Stores, local shops, cafés, bars, restaurants, schools, crèche facilities, gyms, parks, and sporting facilities. Frequent bus services operate within a short stroll of the property, with Hansfield Train Station just a five-minute walk away. The property is also within easy reach of Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, the Phoenix Park, the National Aquatic Centre, and the N3/M50 motorway network, with Dublin International Airport also conveniently accessible.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and by appointment.\r\n\r\nContact us to arrange on 01-4964612."
      },
